[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし、一丁上がりね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, that's one down!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ずいぶん天候が荒れてきたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The weather's really taking a turn for the worse."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、どこかに掴まって！\n油断すると海に真っ逆さまよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone grab onto something! One wrong move and you'll be taking a swim!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嵐は頂獣出現の前触れだって、\nランツェさんが言ってた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze warned us that storms often precede the Apexi's appearance..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん……警戒が必要だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah... we'd better stay alert."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "揺れが酷いので、酔わないように気を付けてください！\n気分が悪い人は医務室へ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The ship's rocking pretty badly, so watch out for seasickness! Anyone feeling unwell should head to the infirmary!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うぅ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Urgh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大丈夫？\u3000レスナちゃん……うぐっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You okay, Resna...? Ugh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナちゃん……こそ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I should be asking... you that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ～。船酔いね。あたしは浮いてるから平気だけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Seasickness, huh? Good thing I can just float around!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "慣れるために、訓練もしてきたんですけど……\n侮っていました……嵐の海の力を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We trained for this, but... I really underestimated... these stormy seas..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナさん。ゆっくり横になって、楽にして",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here, Resna. Just lie down and try to relax."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、イザナも。楽な姿勢でゆーっくり息をするのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You too, Izana. Take slow, deep breaths in a comfortable position."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "き、騎士なのに……情けないよ。\n二人とも……平気なんだ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Some knight I am... How are you two... holding up so well?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わたしたちは船旅には慣れてるからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're just used to sailing, that's all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嵐も収まってきてる。もう少しの辛抱よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The storm's starting to calm down. Just hang in there a little longer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "船長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Captain"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなら……このまま進めますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then we can... keep going..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このくらいの嵐は想定してましたし、\n荒波は乗り越えるって決めたんですから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We prepared for storms like this... and I made up my mind to overcome any rough waters..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だね。こんなの……慣れればどうってことないよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This'll be... nothing once we get used to it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。まずは持ち直すべきですが、気持ちが折れて\nいないのは重畳です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While you should focus on recovery first, I'm pleased to see your spirits remain unbroken."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]